window.products.push({"id":954009,"name":"Butter Knife Stainless Steel - Multi-function with Serrated Edge - Shredding Slots-Butter Scooper and Ergonomic Handle (Silver, 1)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61cVpoXXkmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"One Spreader Knife, Multiple Uses - No More Waiting For Butter To Soften! Have no idea about how to soften a bulk hard butter quickly? Apply cold butter on the bread but tear the soft bread into pieces? Can't make perfect butter swirls? Things would be much easier with 3-in-1 spreading knives: Peanut Butter Knife Separating bulk butter in order to serve different people. Cut the edge of your toast bread. The Quality stainless blade adds durability and perfectly prevents scratch. Butter Curler By scraping the butter into the spaghetti-like form, this butter knife could also act as a butter curler. As swirls could melt quickly and easily, so you could spare more time enjoying your delicious food. Butter Spreader The wide blade is ready to spread your butter, cheese or jam onto the bread before you serve your children. No more mess or dirty hands anymore. Perfect Design The cheese knife with serrated edge cut the cheese quickly & easily. Large surface helps to apply the butter evenly on your bread. The round edge prevents accidental hurt (except the blade part). Specification: Material: stainless steel Color: silver Size: 10.2 x 1 inches Warm Tips: 1.Better to hold the hole knife at a 20°angle instead of 90°. 2.Do not use the butter curler on already softening butter. 3. Hold the butter tight when scratching on its surface. Package Includes: 1 spread knife","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61cVpoXXkmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AMTAKK","source_asin":"B08CK4F15G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-954009","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08CK4F15G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08CK4F15G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
