window.products.push({"id":954077,"name":"TIANSHU Throw Pillow Cover, Solid Color Velvet Decorative Square Pillow Covers Cushion Cases Pillowcases for Sofa Bedroom Car (45x45CM,Set of 4, Wine ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71taglhbkOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"❤Do you need a cushion cover? Yes! TIANSHU velvet cushion cover is perfect for decorating your room in a simple and fashion way. Suitable for living room, bedroom,kid's room, sofa, couch, chair, bed, car, seat, floor, bench, office, cafe, ect. The Throw Pillow Cover can not only protect your expensive pillow insert, but also mix and match with your other pillows and furniture to fresh up your home. By these Decorative Pillow Cover, you will have a cozy living place and also will receive lots of compliments from your families and friends. These also are nice holiday gifts for your family and friends. ❤Why us? MIX & MATCH: TIANSHU Throw Pillow Case is available in 12 colors so you can match whichever color you think that will go best with your decor. COMFORT: This velvet cushion case goes perfectly with your silk quilt or plush pajamas. It is so comfortable to lean on and it is terrific to sleep on. SIZE: 18\" x 18\" fits normal square pillow which sizing from 19\" to 20\". SOFTNESS: When you run your fingers across the surface, it almost feels like there isn't anything there. It’s smoother than silk and as soft as baby skin. MATERIAL & WORKMANSHIP: Solid shinning velvet on both side of the Pillow Protective Cover. The Pillow cases Protector has an invisible zipper closure/ Hidden Zipper, opening around 37cm-39cm. ❤How to care your throw pillow cover? Hand wash or wash by machine, separate with other clothing, gently cycle only, No Bleach, No Ironing, low temperature if necessary. ❤What you get? ✔2-piece TIANSHU Velvet Cushion Cover ; ✔12-Months No Risk Money Back ; ✔Friendly Response Within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71taglhbkOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TIANSHU","source_asin":"B07D6LD2LM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-954077","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07D6LD2LM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07D6LD2LM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":954078,"name":"Polish Pottery Medium Round Baker with Handles made by Ceramika Artystyczna (Blue Poppies Theme) + Certificate of Authenticity","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":72.96,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71FJKhWUWmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Polish Pottery Medium Round Baker with Handles made by Ceramika Artystyczna, Blue Poppies Theme Certificate of Authenticity and origin is included Dimensions: 2.05\" high, 8.11\" wide, 9.92\" long, (max. outside edge or handle) Capacity: 29oz (filled to the rim) Polmedia Polish Pottery Stoneware is: * Hand crafted and hand painted in Boleslawiec, Poland * Microwave safe, dishwasher safe, oven safe up to 480 F, freezer safe * Lead and cadmium free * Crack and chip resistant * Intended for everyday use, easy to clean * Highly collectable About Polish Pottery Polish pottery is known for its versatility in the kitchen and on the table. It is safe for use with food in the microwave, freezer, oven and dishwasher. Polish stoneware is resilient to abrasives making it durable and resistant to scratching or chipping. It distributes heat evenly for perfect baking and is also nonstick for easy clean-up, making it easy to care for. The bright patterns never fade, and are offered in thousands of variations to mix and match. It is this combination of function and beauty that makes Polish pottery so appealing. The pottery is fired in electric and gas kilns at temperatures exceeding 2200 degrees Fahrenheit. This results in a stoneware that is meant to resist aging and provide lasting beauty that stands the test of time. Polish stoneware is lead and cadmium free.Polish Pottery is hand crafted and hand painted in the Boleslawiec region of Poland. This region is famous for its naturally found white clay which artisans have used for centuries to craft this durable and beautiful stoneware. Each piece of pottery is carefully formed and painted by hand to ensure that exceptional attention to detail is paid to each piece. The most beautiful and intricate patterns are called UNIKAT patterns. These patterns bear the artist’s signature.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71FJKhWUWmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Polmedia Polish Pottery","source_asin":"B06XHRJ3W7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-954078","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06XHRJ3W7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06XHRJ3W7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
