window.products.push({"id":954086,"name":"WellnessMats Original Collection Anti-Fatigue Floor Mat, Black, 72 in. x 24 in. x ¾ in. Polyurethane – Ergonomic Support Pad for Home, Kitchen, Garage","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":299.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31Nsz5ue-EL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"SLEEK & ERGONOMIC. A favorite of professional and home chefs alike, the WellnessMats Original Collection floor mat has long been the mat of choice with its sleek, ergonomic design and smooth surface. The Original offers comfort and performance, is supportive and resilient, easy to clean, and the beveled edges will never curl. Plus, its one-piece construction means no delamination ever. SUPERIOR STANDING SUPPORT. Standing for periods of time on hard surfaces can put stress on the body, causing fatigue, aches, and discomfort. Our ergonomically designed mats help provide padded support with a soft, smooth surface and buoyant core that may help reduce muscle and joint fatigue as well as stress on the lower extremities. NON-SKID & ADA COMPLIANT. Made from our proprietary Advanced Polyurethane Technology, our padded mats will not delaminate, the edges will not curl, nor will our mats puncture or slide. These mats are durable, non-toxic, and latex free and provide a non-slip top and bottom surface with 20°, no-trip beveled edges that are ADA compliant. WASHABLE & EASY TO CLEAN. All of our products require little to no special care. Most spills or surface stains can easily be cleaned with warm water and a towel or mop. For more difficult stains, mild soap and water are recommended. WellnessMats can be spot cleaned, swept, or stick vacuumed (non-brush rolled) as needed. MADE IN THE USA. We take pride in supporting the health and well-being of our customers and the economy in our communities. Our mats are proudly made 100% in the USA and come with an unprecedented 20-Year Warranty. From the high-quality construction to the luxurious comfort and support, each step reaffirms your decision to own a WellnessMat.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31Nsz5ue-EL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Wellness Mat","source_asin":"B00332YKIA","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-954086","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00332YKIA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00332YKIA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
