window.products.push({"id":954116,"name":"OTARTU Borosilicate Glass Carafe with Drip-Free Lid, Stovetop Safe, 35 oz Glass Water Pitcher Fridge Carafe Ice Tea Maker, Juice Glassware.","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51zFZRKDb9L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"BOROSILICATE GLASS: This carafe is made from borosilicate glass, withstand temperature 0 to 300 ℉, so you can pour boiling water into this carafe safely. Dishwasher safe, but hand washing is recommended. MULTIPURPOSE: Drip free carafe can be used for all types of beverages as well as for decanting and serving wine. 304 STAINLESS STEEL DRIP FEE LID :This glass carafe has a drip-free spill proof bottle pourer, opens automatically when you pour, This means that you avoid the fridge aftertaste or ice cubes splashing down into the tumbler, The lid is composed by a round stainless top cover, a silicone bottom lid and a stainless stem that holds both items together. CLASSIC DESIGN: The fridge carafe has been designed in a simple, classic milk bottle shape – the size of which fits neatly into the fridge door. The mouth of the carafe is large enough for ice cubes and sliced lemon. And, of course, there is the added bonus that the carafe is a decorative element on the table. 35oz CAPACITY:Dia. 3.5'' by 10.5'' H, Its means suitable for most of fridge, Small size make sure hold it well even kids. If you want to make different taste beverage, then this is the one you need, get each for ice tea, blueberry juice, boba tea.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51zFZRKDb9L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OTARTU","source_asin":"B08HNL4VSB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-954116","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08HNL4VSB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08HNL4VSB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
