window.products.push({"id":954136,"name":"Creative Linens Holiday Christmas Tablecloth 33\" Round Embroidered Bell Ornament Pinecone Winter Table Topper Red Gold","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71i4FSoBRIL._AC_SL1106_.jpg","description":"This gorgeous high-quality embroidered Christmas Jingle Bell/Ornament/Pine Cone Tablecloth/Topper has a festive red satin background with winter scene of embroidered golden bells, colorful ornaments, pine cones, ribbons, holly leaves and red berries scattered on it. A lot of the embroidery are outlined with shiny metallic gold thread. It also features a scalloped border with embroidery and cutworks. It is a perfect addition for your holiday dinner/decoration. Imported. 100% polyester. Machine care.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71i4FSoBRIL._AC_SL1106_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Creative Linens","source_asin":"B077VJN659","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-954136","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B077VJN659","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B077VJN659","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
