window.products.push({"id":954249,"name":"The Perfect Banquet- Dinnerware Set for 25 Guests Disposable Plastic Plates Wedding Party Travel Gift Dinner Dessert Salad Elegant Premium Quality Reu","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81MvWVOIsdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"It's a walk down memory lane... These nostalgic plates are elegantly designed to bring back memories of yesteryear. These are plastic reproductions of the types of plates our parents and grandparents used to own. It's vintage style, old-school but most relevant now. It's a revival of the Golden Era. For any type of celebrations, these plates will prove fabulous. They are of premium quality perfect for Weddings, Quinceaneras, Debutante Balls, Anniversaries, Birthdays, Showers, Graduations, Reunions, Charity Dinners, Annual Events, Gatherings, Picnics, etc. Attractive plates make for a tastier meal. Each box contains: 25 pcs of Dinner Plates size 10.25\" 25 pcs of Dinner Plates size 10.25\" 25 pcs of Dessert/Salad Plates size 7.5\" 25 pcs of Dessert/Salad Plates size 7.5\" Matched with fine plastic silverware, these wonderfully glossy scalloped plastic plates will definitely add a touch of retro-glam to your special day. Allow yourself and your Guests to be transported back in time! After the event, dispose of them to save you time and energy that are better spent with your Guests and loved ones. Spare yourself the hassle of cleaning up, or reuse them by all means. Help save Mother Earth through recycling. Everyone deserves a celebration but it is wise not to overspend. Smart consumers live big, spend small. These plates also make light travel companions. Bring them with you in your RVs, campervans, motorhomes, travel trailers, boats or yachts. Also recommended for minimalist lifestyle living in simple tiny houses, container homes, recreational resort cottages, mobile homes and office pantries. Looking for housewarming gifts for family or bachelor friends? These are perfect for those who appreciate easy entertaining and casual everyday elegance. Celebrate life! Cherish your time together and enjoy your meals. Stay safe, The Perfect Banquet 💗","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81MvWVOIsdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"The Perfect Banquet","source_asin":"B0811G5RX4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-954249","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0811G5RX4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0811G5RX4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
