window.products.push({"id":954305,"name":"2 Washcloths, 2 Hand Towels, 2 Bath Towels, Soft & Absorbent 600 GSM Premium Hotel & Spa Quality 6 Piece Genuine Turkish Cotton Bathroom Towel Set, Aq","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81POhnQWWnL._AC_SL1487_.jpg","description":"American Bath Towels are offering you bath mats in addition to elegant towel sets. You can use them in front of your shower cabin as you may want to step on a pile of genuine cotton to absorb the water on your feet right away. These bath mats are not like other bulky bath rugs as they are over there just for your exact needs. They look like towels but they differ in technical specifications from towels. These banded bath mats can be used anywhere in your house, from bathroom to entrance, and we have color options for you to match the setting of your home. They will match your decoration completely as they are not too flashy or too flat, they will complete the loose end. These bath mats have 900 GSM (gram per square meter) value and that is why they soak up a huge amount of water when you step on them. These absorbent bath mats are made of Ringspun G enuine Cotton . They feel substantial as they are thick enough to make you feel the softness when you step on them. These soft bath mats measure 20x34 inches and this size matches with the door width. These durable products are also double-stitched to last longer than you expect. Please follow washing instructions . Machine wash on warm heat and tumble dry on low heat, do not use bleach. Customer satisfaction is our number 1 priority. If you want to return your product for any reason, you can, within 30 days for a full refund.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81POhnQWWnL._AC_SL1487_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AMERICAN BATH TOWELS","source_asin":"B07TKC9BB2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-954305","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07TKC9BB2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07TKC9BB2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":954306,"name":"Mornucipia ceramic rice bowl, 12oz cereals, ice cream, snacks and desserts. Set Of 4(Navy, 4.72 inches)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81nZBXpIVpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"1. Striped design-striped tableware is more stable and easy to hold on the bowl. 2. A variety of colors-bright colors, stripes on the outside, make the bowl look more elegant and generous, very suitable for decorating any tableware. 3. Deep enough-they are deep enough to hold grains and soup without splashing on the body, the bottom of the bowl is wide, so it is difficult to accidentally tip over. 4. Practical bowls-they are very practical and suitable for holding everything, especially soup, noodles, oatmeal, cereals, popcorn and ice cream. 5. A set of four bowls are packed in a box filled with bubble cotton, which can reach your hands very safely","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81nZBXpIVpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mornucipia","source_asin":"B08ZK36XYS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-954306","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08ZK36XYS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08ZK36XYS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":954307,"name":"=Bath Tub Mat,Extra Long 40x16 Inchs Non-Slip Shower Mat with 200 Suction Cups and Drain Holes, Bathtub Mats Bathroom Mats,Anti Slip Bathroom Accessor","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51K+34jDFXL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","description":"We are committed to the highest levels of quality products and excellent customer service. Bath mats provide super-wide coverage, Anti-Clip and Comfortable, You MUST LOVE IT ! Specification: Size: 40\"x16\" Color: Grey,White,Green,Brown,Clear Material: High Quality Vinyl Package including: 1* bathtub mat Our mat Anti-Slip , No Latex ,No Chemical Smell, No BPA,SCIENTIFIC DESIGN for Your perfect Life. TopPop extra large mat features small holes throughout to allow water to circulate.Extra long bathtub mat is suitable for almost all smooth surface bathtubs. You can make it for daily use ,or be a gift for your girlfirend,parents,relatives and anyone you love. Protect them from slipping when showering and kindly let's them just enjoy the shower time . TopPop bath mat Easy to clean and convenience your life, so the same applies to public bathrooms, gyms, schools and other public places. Tips: 1. It is recommended to soak the bath mat in warm water of 30 degrees Celsius,  and please use neutral detergent for 10 minutes before first use to remove any dirt . 2.Be sure to use the bath mat against the smooth surface of the bathtub or bathroom floor, otherwise the suction cup will not work properly 3.When you start to take a shower, please wet the bathtub or bathroom floor with an appropriate amount of water, then carefully place the bath mat in the center so that the suction cup can work 4.After shower lift the mat at one corner and peel back. Rinse the mat thoroughly with water and hang to dry. Do not directly expose bath mat to sunlight. 5.when you leave the bath mat, please be careful.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51K+34jDFXL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HOZON","source_asin":"B08BHHMM23","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-954307","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08BHHMM23","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08BHHMM23","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
