window.products.push({"id":954354,"name":"Quattro Stagioni Bottle - .4L (13.5 oz)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51E0dm65t4L._AC_SL1318_.jpg","description":"This beautiful 13.5-ounce junior version of an old-fashioned milk bottle is right at home in a modern kitchen. The classic shape is embossed on one side with a swirling script spelling out 'Quattro Stagioni' (Four Seasons) and a decorative motif on the other showing fruit, flowers, and a beehive surrounded by twining vines. It has measurements marked on the side. The shape allows convenient storage in the pantry or refrigerator. It's the ideal bottle for storing and serving milk or creamer for coffee--but it has so many other uses, too. It's an easy \"grab and go\" for transporting smoothies or storing baby food. Use it for a colorful food display or as a vessel for homemade food gifts. Of course, one of the more common uses today is to hold herbal remedies, tonics, and syrups. You're only limited by your own imagination!The same floral design is repeated in black on the gold lids. The interior seal of the air-tight lid is guaranteed to keep freshness in and air out so it can even be used for home canning projects. In fact, instructions for home canning come with each bottle. The glass is odor and stain proof, food-safe, and can be put in the dishwasher. Made in Italy. Sold as single glass bottle Sold as single glass bottle Capacity 40 cl - 13.5 oz Capacity 40 cl - 13.5 oz Height with lid 155.5 mm - 6\" Height with lid 155.5 mm - 6\" Diameter 73.5 mm - 3\" Diameter 73.5 mm - 3\" Lid size 56 mm Lid size 56 mm Made of soda-lime glass Made of soda-lime glass Glass parts of the jar are dishwasher safe. Glass parts of the jar are dishwasher safe. Hand washing recommended for the metal lid. Hand washing recommended for the metal lid. Made in Italy Made in Italy About Bormioli Rocco Since 1825 Bormioli Rocco has made glass to give your food stories their best setting. At Bormioli Rocco, they believe in the table as the place where some of the most profound and most authentic relationships are created, revived, and celebrated. It is the place where you celebrate special events and anniversaries, as well as the place where each day can be made a bit more special. They designed to give the table a","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51E0dm65t4L._AC_SL1318_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bormioli Rocco","source_asin":"B01DENOI8E","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-954354","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01DENOI8E","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01DENOI8E","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
