window.products.push({"id":954407,"name":"Artdix Roman Shades Blinds Window Shades - Black 23 W x 36 H Inches (1 Piece) Blackout Solid Thermal Fabric Custom Made Roman Shades for Windows, Door","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":96.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51kts7fPdWL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"How to measure Inside mount Window Width: To find the width, measure the top, middle and bottom within your window recess. Use the narrowest width as your window width. Window Length: To find the length, measure exact window-recess length at left, middle and right side. Use the longest height as the window length. Window Depth: Minimum 2 inches required. Ordering: Choose a width that is 1/4 inch smaller than the widow width from above. Choose a length that is same or longer than your window length. Outside mount Determine where the roman shade is to be placed. You will need a minimum 7/8 inches of flat mounting space above your window to accommodate the mounting hardware. Width: Choose a roman blind width that is same or greater than the window width. We recommend add 3-6 inches extra to the measured width to maximize light control and privacy. Length: Measure exact measured-length from the top of the proposed headrail location to the base of sill. If there is no sill, measure where you would like the window roman blind to drop. Add 8-10 inches to the length for optimum light control and privacy. Ordering: Choose a width that is same or wider than the product width from above.  Choose a length that is same or longer than your measured length. How to Get a Custom Roman Shade 1. Get the mount type (inside or outside mount) according to your window type 2. Get the roman shade size according to above measurement method 3. Email us the following information 3.1 Product you like (you can send us LINK or ASIN)  3.2 Mount type 3.3 Roman shade size 4. We give you order link 5. Receive the roman shade, if have any problem, please send message to us or call us, we can solve any problem together with you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51kts7fPdWL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Artdix","source_asin":"B08BHKYPW3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-954407","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08BHKYPW3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08BHKYPW3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":954408,"name":"6 Pack Size #28 Tapered Cork Plugs for Jars and Bottles (2.1 x 1.88 x 0.94 In)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71rMe3KLNFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"#28 Cork Stopper: Use these tapered corks for bottles, jars, spice containers, and crafts; these create a tight seal to ensure contents stay securely inside; bottles not included Personalized Gifts: Pair the large corks with a glass jar or picture to create custom-themed party favors for an upcoming wedding reception, baby shower, birthday party, or holiday celebration Reliable Quality: The cork lids are made from cork material that is designed for long-term use without easily bending or crumbling over time Dimensions: Each tapered cork's bottom diameter measures 1.88 inches; top diameter measures approximately 2.1 inches Comes With: This pack includes 6 corks for crafts, bottles, and DIY projects","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71rMe3KLNFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Juvale","source_asin":"B07YCYPVKD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-954408","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07YCYPVKD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07YCYPVKD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":954409,"name":"Ginkgo International Bergen 20-Piece Stainless Steel Flatware Set, Service for 4","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":46.47,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ey531i7bL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product description 079914361156 Features: -Bergen collection. -Set includes 4 dinner forks, 4 dinner spoons, 4 dinner knives, 4 salad forks, 4 teaspoons. -Versatile pattern. Finish: -Satin. Material: -Stainless steel. Handle Material: -Stainless steel. Number of Items Included: -20. Dimensions: Dinner Fork Overall Height - Top to Bottom: -8.13\". Dinner Fork Width - Side to Side: -1\". Dinner Fork Depth - Front to Back: -1.25\". Dinner Fork Weight: -0.188 lbs. Soup Spoon Overall Height - Top to Bottom: -7.75\". Soup Spoon Width - Side to Side: -1.5\". Soup Spoon Depth - Front to Back: -1\". Soup Spoon Weight: -0.194 lbs. Knife Overall Height - Top to Bottom: -9.5\". Knife Width - Side to Side: -0.88\". Knife Depth - Front to Back: -0.25\". Knife Weight: -0.344 lbs. Amazon.com Bergen's all-over satin finish appeals to those who like an understated, not flashy, place setting. Simply yet elegantly designed, Bergen flatware features straight lines on the business ends--fork tines, oblong spoon bowls, and knife blade--balanced with gracefully rounded tab ends that lift up off the table. This is a moderated priced pattern that suits a casual, modern lifestyle. This 20-piece set makes a great gift for someone setting up a new kitchen or outfitting a vacation home. Included are four of each of the following: 9-3/4-inch dinner knife; 8-1/8-inch dinner fork; 7-inch salad fork; 7-5/8-inch soup spoon; and 6-3/8-inch teaspoon. Bergen, like most Ginkgo patterns, is made of 18/10 stainless steel and is safe for the dishwasher. Prolonged exposure to acidic foods can cause spotting, which a stainless-steel polish will remove. A family-owned business since 1977, Ginkgo International is dedicated to quality design and value when it comes to flatware for the home. --Ann Bieri What's in the Box 4 place settings. Each place setting consists of: 9-3/4-inch dinner knife; 8-1/8-inch dinner fork; 7-inch salad fork; 7-5/8-inch soup spoon; and 6-3/8-inch teaspoon. 20 pieces total.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ey531i7bL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ginkgo","source_asin":"B00RYR69JI","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-954409","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00RYR69JI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00RYR69JI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
