window.products.push({"id":954622,"name":"MEFASO Automatic Soap Dispenser, Touchless Foaming Soap Dispenser, Stainless Steel Nozzle, Infrared Sensor, Rechargeable, for Bathroom Kitchen 8.45 oz","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71e+lnKohrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[0.2S Quick & Rich Foaming] - The automatic Soap Dispenser with less time to create the best result! FASO soap dispenser for the bathroom uses the latest precise infrared motion sensor and powerful pump to provide you with dream-fast foaming. [Resource & Money Saving] - The foaming soap dispenser works well with all kinds of foaming hand liquid. The capacity counts 250ml/8.45 oz., which it can use for at least a month for a family. [No More Drips] - The stainless steel nozzle with a sealed outlet avoids leakage onto your countertop and reduces waste. Say goodbye to the wet and messy countertop. A detachable container prevents liquid from leaking into the battery compartment and causing a mess on your countertop. [Triple Safety Design for Long Term Using] - IPX3-waterproof grade and waterproof plug make this automatic foaming soap dispenser suitable for any wet countertop. Note: Hand sanitiser should be diluted with water before use. The ratio of hand sanitiser to water is about 1:6-1:8. [About MEFASO] - We are committed to serving our customers with reliable products and empathetic service. Each product passed the quality inspection. You will get a 24 Months-Warranty for replacement. Please feel free to contact us if there is any problem.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71e+lnKohrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MEFASO","source_asin":"B08T177J2X","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-954622","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08T177J2X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08T177J2X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":954623,"name":"ZWILLING Four Star 7-inch Hollow Edge Santoku Knife","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":109.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51N1xgjo7pL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Product description FOUR STAR is the top-selling knife series of ZWILLING J.A. Henckels worldwide. Honed and hand-finished by the most skilled artisans, this celebrated collection is the model of safety, ergonomics, and comfort. Thanks to their seamless transition from bolster to handle, the knives are comfortable to use for long periods of time. The bolster provides the right balance while acting as a safe finger guard.The knives are made of proprietary special formula steel that has been perfected over the years. Combined with ZWILLING's signature ice-hardening technique, these FRIODUR blades are harder, sharper, they will NOT STAIN or chip and they retain their sharpness longer. Precision-forged from a single piece of steel, the SIGMAFORGE knives have an exceptionally sturdy, balanced and flexible blade. Amazon.com The Japanese version of the chefs knife, the santoku is useful for straight chopping, mincing, and slicing of larger quantities of vegetables and meat. Cooks with smaller hands may prefer this 7-inch blade as the shorter length offers better control while cutting. The width also provides a great platform for transporting chopped vegetables from cutting board to sauté pan. This version of the santoku actually has a hollow edge or oval cut-outs along the blade. The benefit to this blade style is that cooks can cut paper-thin slices and individual slices wont stick to the blade. Part of the Four Star series of cutlery, this santoku has a fully forged high-carbon stainless-steel blade. The blade, bolster, and tang are welded of one piece of metal using Henckelss Sinter Metal Component Technology, which distributes the right quantities of metal to each part of the knife. The result is a longer-lasting edge and a more consistent angle on the blade. The blade has also undergone Henckelss Friodur ice-hardening process, which further strengthens it and protects it from discoloration. The black polypropelene handle offers a secure and comfortable grip and is hygienically attached so there are no gaps between the handle and blade for food to become trapped. This santoku should be hand washed and is covered by a lifetime warranty. --Cristina Vaamonde","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51N1xgjo7pL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ZWILLING","source_asin":"B09NN25J1H","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-954623","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09NN25J1H","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09NN25J1H","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
