window.products.push({"id":954713,"name":"Premium 10 Inch Handmade Bamboo Steamer - Two Tier Baskets - Dim Sum Dumpling & Bao Bun Chinese Food Steamers - Steam Baskets For Rice, Vegetables, Me","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71pamO6j1wS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"COOK AUTHENTIC ASIAN FOOD! With our premium bamboo steamer you can steam all types of food! Veggies, rice, dumplings, fish and meat! This high quality, 100% bamboo cooker has an incredible two tiered design that allows you to cook multiple things at once! Bamboo cookers are a rapidly growing alternative that allow for a lightweight and durable product! Our steaming baskets are an immediate upgrade to any set of kitchenware and will provide endless delicious meals! HIGH QUALITY DESIGN AND MATERIAL! This 100% premium quality bamboo steamer is made with value and craftsmanship at the forefront! Providing endless cooking and steaming opportunities, this asian food cooker comes with a variety of wonderful tools helping make it a perfect steam pot for a large variety of kitchen ideas! Lightweight and durable, these steamers are top tier and have no plastic. They are easy to clean and fit in most cooking pots! WHAT'S INCLUDED WITH THIS STEAMER!? Our 100% premium bamboo steaming baskets include 2 sets of chopsticks, 1 sauce plate, and 20 wax steamer liners, and will also include a bamboo steamer step by step guide on how to cook or what to cook for dinner! What a bundle! With all of the products included with this asian steam pot, you'll be ready to create your own bowls of rice, baskets of fish, fresh vegetable oriented meals, tender meats and more! OUR PREMIUM BAMBOO STEAMER IS A GREAT GIFT, TOO! Whether you know a kitchen enthusiast that loves asian food, someone who is just learning to cook, or maybe a person that's been looking for an alternative way to prepare regular meals. The bamboosteamer is a great gift for anyone! It's versatile and lasts a long time. It will immediately make cooking and steaming food more fun! Our foodsteamer set is sure to be a welcomed addition to any household, and would make an awesome surprise gift! DESIGN IMPROVEMENT AND TESTING: While our products are manufactured overseas (let's be honest, what isn't these days..) ALL of our DESIGN IMPROVEMENT AND TESTING was done right here in the United States. Our USA customer service team stands by to provide you with exceptional, lightning quick responses to your every concern. Your satisfaction is our #1 priority!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71pamO6j1wS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"i-PLAYLOFT","source_asin":"B07TXCBVBB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-954713","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07TXCBVBB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07TXCBVBB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":954714,"name":"Arm & Hammer Fragrance Free Hanging Moisture Absorber and Odor Eliminator 2 Pack - Traps Moisture for Fresher, Cleaner Air","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91H-7CoUoXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Arm & Hammer 2 pack Hanging Moisture Absorber and Odor Eliminator is your solution for continuous cleaner, fresher air. This musty odor eliminator works by attracting and trapping excess moisture to maintain an optimal humidity level. It works in the closet, laundry room, pantry, bathroom, and storage areas, where excess moisture is an issue. This unique deodorizer has 15% more moisture absorbing power plus the power of baking soda for odor elimination versus the leading brand. Think of it as a non-electric dehumidifier to keep areas and clothes smelling fresh, preventing damp feeling fabrics. To use this convenient, simply unwrap the moisture absorber bag and hang it in a moist area. Before too long you’ll see the first drops of moisture collect in the transparent collection pocket. When moisture absorbing crystals are completely dissolved, discard and replace. Available in Clean Burst and Fragrance Free. Keep out of reach of children. Read and follow all label directions.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91H-7CoUoXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Arm & Hammer","source_asin":"B01KYZ10V8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-954714","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01KYZ10V8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01KYZ10V8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
