window.products.push({"id":954929,"name":"Pfaltzgraff Satin Montclaire 65-Piece Stainless-Steel Flatware Set with Wood Storage Caddy, Service for 12","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51-9-kT40jL._AC_.jpg","description":"Pfaltzgraff Satin Montclaire 65-Piece Set Service for 12-Set Includes 12 Each, Salad Forks, Dinner Forks, Dinner Spoons, teaspoonns, Dinner Knives plus 1 Tablespoon, 1 Cold Meat Fork, Sugar Spoon, Butter Serving Knife, Pierced Tablespoon, plus a caddy. Stainless steel is completely dishwasher-safe and easy to maintain. Follow these few simple hints to ensure that your fine stainless steel flatware lasts for many years: Wash flatware prior to using for the first time. Avoid soaking stainless flatware in water for a prolonged period of time or overnight Before placing in washer, rinse food from flatware When loading your dishwasher, make sure knife blades do not come into contact with other utensils. This will prevent blades from nicking or scratching other pieces. Use a mild non-chloride detergent. Never pour detergent directly onto flatware. In hard water areas, use a water-softening agent to avoid spotting or pitting. Always remove stainless flatware from the dishwasher shortly after the drying cycle is complete. This decreases the amount of time your flatware is exposed to a very moist and hot environment and allows it to dry in cool drier air. Should detergent film build up on your flatware, wash (either by hand or in a dishwasher) and hand-dry to remove film. If stubborn stains or rust should occur, use a non-abrasive stainless or metal polish paste or cream. Avoid grainy cleaners. Limit exposure to water that has a high mineral content, high chloride dishwashing detergent and foods that contain chloride (table salt, mustard, mayonnaise and eggs) as pitting or spotting may occur.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51-9-kT40jL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pfaltzgraff","source_asin":"B002EQ9JFK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-954929","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B002EQ9JFK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B002EQ9JFK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":954930,"name":"Modern Console Table with Cabinet,36'' Sofa Table with 2 Drawers and 1 Shelf for Hallway Living Room Bedroom (White)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81N5DEBep0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Effortlessly fill in that blank space in your home with this console table, designed to fit all of your needs and more. Crafted with a classic vintage appearance, this table comes complete with two front facing cabinet doors that open to reveal a spacious interior, perfect for stowing away your larger necessities and keeping them out of sight. The 2 drawers minimize clutter, offering plenty of space to hold smaller items such as keys or mails while the spacious bottom shelf is the perfect place for storage baskets, shoes and more. Crafted with thick Pine and MDF wood slabs and accented with quality iron handles, this piece is manufactured for quality and exudes a high-end appeal that will leave your guests talking. Weight and Dimensions: Overall: 36''*13.9''*34.3'' Shelf: 36''*13.3”*4.5” Clearance to Floor: 4.5'' Specifications: Table Material: Solid + Manufactured Wood Table Base Material: Solid Wood Base Material Details: Pine Drawers: Yes Number of Drawers: 2 Shelves Included: Yes Number of Shelves: 1 Weight Capacity: 140 Pounds Supplier Intended and Approved Use: Residential Use Country of Origin: VietnamNote: We DO NOT accept free returns for certain circumstances: 1.Once we get the shipping confirmation from customers and the order has been shipped out via trucking service, any cancellation requests will not be allowed. 2.Returns based on customer’s personal preference and feelings is not free and we will not be responsible for the return shipping cost. *Simple Assembly is required. * Manual measurement might result in minor error. * Actual color may differ slightly due to lighting during photography or your monitor display settings. Welcome to shopping with us, your satisfaction is our most motivation. Any questions Please feel free to contact by email.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81N5DEBep0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Generic","source_asin":"B09R7Z6YF9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-954930","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09R7Z6YF9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09R7Z6YF9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
