window.products.push({"id":954940,"name":"Outer Space Planets High Chair Banner - Astronaut Rocket 1st Birthday Boy High Chair ONE Banner - First Trip Around the Sun Party Decor (OUTER SPACE H","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61D03ADx84L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🚀HOW TO CHOOSE A FIRST YEAR BIRTHDAY DECORATION— For parents, when you are choosing a first-year anniversary decoration for your child, there are all kinds of birthday decoration banners and birthday hats in different stores. Have you made a choice? Difficulty? Alright, Silvia is here to send you a wonderful addition to your party decor! 🚀SHARING FROM THE DESIGNER - My name is Silvia, I am a new mother, I have a lovely daughter, I would like to say to all parents: the past year has been hard work! I know that you must have poured a lot of love into your baby this year. When you watch your baby grow up, and on her/his first birthday, of course, you should use suitable birthday props to take pictures of your baby and share them with your family and friends. 🚀APPROPRIATE PHOTO PROPS - Tell you, this banner is not easy. At this time, for the mothers/fathers who are worried about which banner to choose, you will grateful found these to help us celebrate our little one’s first trip around the sun, We can only imagine how our party supplies banners can help you light up a beautiful night and make it an unforgettable moment for family and friends. 🚀WHY CHOOSE THIS BANNER - This Trip Around the Sun Highchair birthday banner and is designed by myself,and produced by my team, which is very suitable for your little one’s first birthday. As a mother, I know you must be the same as me and want the best for your baby. This Banner is with a picture and ribbon.Trust me, you will love it. 🚀THIS IS A WARM LITTLE SHOP — Thanks for visiting SILVIA LOVE LIFE.Silvia is a new mother. This is a shop to share the baby’s birthday decorations, there are birthday banners, birthday hats, cake toppers and so on.All of our products are made in a smoke free environment.while you’re clicking through my link, be sure to check out the rest of the shop. Let's grow together.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61D03ADx84L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HUHJRUAR","source_asin":"B09ZB18DK3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-954940","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09ZB18DK3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09ZB18DK3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
