window.products.push({"id":954951,"name":"Santa Barbara Design Studio Lolita Holiday Mini-Wine Ornament, Letter P","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41iNjoMVc1L._AC_.jpg","description":"Mini-Wine holiday glass ornaments are hand-painted with some of Lolita's famous wine glass designs. Uniquely painted with letters of the alphabet so everyone can have their initials on the tree, this ornament is sure to be a Christmas favorite and would make a great gift year round. Mini ornament is 3.25-inch tall and comes with a signature round gift box, a satin ribbon accent and a fancy scroll metal hanger.To put it simply, at Santa Barbara Design Studio, we make what we love and we love what we make. The one and only Lolita. It all started with a girls' night out. One that contained more than the usual laughter and fun. Browsing for the first time through a martini menu, Lolita was inspired by the recipes. After being served a Cosmopolitan, her creative imagination made her see the glass differently, the way she thought it should be, a bit more dressed up, perhaps with a pattern, with flair and with a fabulous recipe on the bottom Lolita took hold of that original idea, hand painted martini glasses, and then took the world by storm in 2004 to become the hottest gift brand in the U.S. Now, after many successful products, designs and collections, she continues to stand behind what she has always believed that life should be lived to its fullest and every moment should be celebrated. What is your moment. Commemorate it with a wine, margarita or martini glass, a shooter, rocks glass or pilsner. For whichever of life's big moments, there is a Lolita style to fit it","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41iNjoMVc1L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Santa Barbara Design Studio","source_asin":"B004JLOECG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-954951","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B004JLOECG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B004JLOECG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
