window.products.push({"id":954956,"name":"Soap Dishes Large 3 Pack Rubber Soap Dish, Square Soap Saver Drain Holder, Household Products Gadgets for Kitchen Shower Sponges Bathroom Appliances B","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51b4FCQJVlL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Plastic Made in USA or Imported PLASTIC & RUBBER 💦【SQUEEZEFREE & PERFECT SIZE & PORTABLE】Each bar soap holder is about 4.7 x 3.1 x 1.8 in (12 x 8 x 4.5 cm), you can put round, square, rectangular soap, but please note that the size should be smaller than the box size. The strong box prevents the soap from being squeezed and deformed. Mini size, easy to store and carry, you can easily put in the luggage or baggage. Even a small handbag is stress-free. It won't take up much space, perfect for travel or going out. 💦【SECURE LATCH & CLOSE TIGHT】Most soap boxes on the market do not have a lockable lid and are not suitable for carrying around. Our soap dishes for bathroom is compact with secure latch which has two pins that fit into holes, it closes tight, preventing the soap and mesh bag from spilling out. They have good sealing and waterproofing effects. The lid of the soap travel case can be closed tightly, will not leakout, and it also effectively prevent water ingress. 💦【QUALITY FIRST & 3 PACK SET & PREFECT GIFT】These soap cases are made of high-quality PP plastic material, different from ordinary materials, our soap storage box has no smell, which is super durable, strong, light and portable, and will not rust. You will get 3 rectangular boxes, so you can put body soap, shampoo soap or hand soap in it. Meet your different needs. It can also be used as a lovely gift for your friends and family. Share practical things with friends to make life happier! 💦【RIDGES DESIGN OF THE PLASTIC SOAP DISH & EASY TO CLEAN】Ridges on the soapbox bottom to prevent it from sticking too tightly with your soap, help keep the soap neat & clean and prolong its lifespan. In order to extend the use time of soap, the best way is to dry the soap before putting it in. The inner wall of the case is smooth and there are no extra gaps, which makes the soap box extremely easy to clean. After use, just simply rinse it. 💦【WIDELY USED & SMALL STORAGE CASE】Our command shower caddy is small in size, waterproof and easy to carry, work well in outdoor or indoor. Perfect for home, bathroom, shower, gym room, garden, yard, balcony. Also good for business trip, hiking, traveling, camping, and other outdoor activities. The small box can not only store soap, but also small items! Like rings, earrings, coins,rubber rings, hairpin, etc., make your storage more orderly and prevent things from being lost during the journey!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51b4FCQJVlL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Milky House","source_asin":"B081DM6636","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-954956","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B081DM6636","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B081DM6636","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
