window.products.push({"id":954983,"name":"OMMO Meat Thermometer","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Tv0rPuoHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"How to Cook Meat Perfectly Like a Chef？ OMMO Wireless thermometer for grilling uses the latest Bluetooth wireless technology 5.0 to offer the most stable connection. With 4 probes can monitor the meat thermometer within a range of 394FT. You can accurately monitor the temperature of four kinds of meat at the same time. How to Pairing Bluetooth with Your Smart Meat Thermometer 1. Download the app \"Smart Life \" from App Store or Google Play (Suitable for Android and IOS). 2. Ensure to place the digital meat thermometer near your phone and enable Bluetooth on your mobile device. 3. Press the thermometer power button for 3s to turn on /off. 4. Add the wireless meat thermometer to your app and both pair successfully. (Note: Please sign in to the app account, your personal info will not be stored and tracked) Warm Tips: 1. Please make sure to enable Bluetooth to be paired correctly. The smartphone and thermometer will alert you when the Bluetooth connection is lost. 2. Please make sure connecting distance range within 393ft so as to ensure Bluetooth normal connection (with no obstructions in between) 3. Please delete the previous phone BBQ record before changing the new phone to pair, to ensure that the Bluetooth pair is normal. 4. When turned on the thermometer and will be a sound, please set the food temperature in the phone to a higher temperature than the preset. 5. Please rinse or wipe the probe after use, but not let it soak in water to avoid malfunctions. 6. Do not touch hot probes with bare hands during or just after cooking. Please always wear heat-resistant gloves. 7. Do not directly put the meat thermometer on the hot surfaces and heat sources.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Tv0rPuoHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OMMO","source_asin":"B083BC5M2X","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-954983","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B083BC5M2X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B083BC5M2X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
